
One-D Runner.

It's a program to control equipment attached to
a microscope to run one-dimensional diffusion
assays.

Equipment controlled.
- Prior ProScan motorized stage.
- Lumencor Sola excitation light source.
- Basler acA1300-200um camera.

A schedule and a capillary holder description
are given to the program.
At times determined in the schedule it takes
images along each of the capillaries.

Original project dir:  2026 ipro 0924v15a.

